idth 0.5 mm) also exceed 0.2 mm though not formally in scope of the track-segment requirement.","Verified the simulation deck work/rc-step/deck.cir against the netlist and values (C1 OUT 0 100n, R1 IN OUT 10k, GND mapped to node 0, J1 correctly excluded as element-free connector); stimulus PWL(0 0 1n 1) is a valid ideal-step approximation; .tran 0.005m 5m gives adequate resolution for tau=1 ms.","Recomputed the analytic response: tau = 10k * 100n = 1.0 ms; V(1 ms) = 1-exp(-1) = 0.6321206 V vs measured 0.6321201 V (within declared 0.62-0.65 V band); V(5 ms) = 1-exp(-5) = 0.9932621 V vs measured 0.9932621 V. ngspice.log measurement lines match the reported check details.","Confirmed board outline containment: all footprints, tracks, via (113,100) and zone (96.5-115.5 x 96.5-107.5) lie within the Edge.Cuts rectangle (96-116 x 96-108).","Reviewed ERC and DRC records (work/erc/erc.json, work/drc/drc.json): zero violations, zero unconnected items, zero parity issues; ignored-check lists are benign for this all-passive design; PWR_FLAG on GND is correctly placed for ERC.","Checked that the unconstrained vout_5ms measurement is consistent with inputs/requirements/fixture-requirements.md, which bounds only the 1 ms point."],"limitations":["work/rc-step/result.raw is binary and was not readable in this packet; waveform verification rests on ngspice.log measurement lines plus analytic recomputation.","B.Cu zone connectivity (J1.3 ground return) was verified from the saved filled_polygon geometry and the DRC/geometry unconnected-items counts, not by an independent refill or geometric recomputation of spoke widths; the read-only candidate forbids a refill pass.","Tolerance, temperature, external loading, ADC sampling, EMI and physical hardware behavior are outside the declared operating conditions and were not assessed, per the fixture's stated scope.","Footprint internal correctness (pad-to-land suitability of the stock KiCad 0805 and pin-header footprints) is taken from the st